    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        193,
        953,
        1505,
        1066
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, funding has been allocated in the Fiscal Year '01 budget for educational reform strategies and innovations, including the support of charter schools through contributions to capital related and start-up costs of such schools, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
