        1504,
        1825
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Charter School Improvement Fund Committee. There is hereby established a City of New York Charter School Improvement Fund Committee (\"the Committee\") reporting to the Mayor, through the Deputy Mayor for Planning, Education and Cultural Affairs. The Committee shall consist of the Commissioner of the Department of Youth and Community Development, who shall serve as Chair, the Commissioner of the Department of Design and Construction and the Director of the Office of Management and Budget, or their designees.",
